      "synthesis": {
        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": true,
        "procedure": "Under air- and water-free Schlenk/glovebox conditions, a hexane solution of PhPH2 (10 wt%) was added slowly to a stirred toluene solution of [LY(μ2-Me)]3(μ3-Me)(μ3-CH2). The mixture turned from yellow-green to yellow and was stirred about 5 h at room temperature. Solvent was removed under vacuum, the oily residue was washed with cold hexane to a yellow powder, redissolved in toluene, concentrated, and crystallized at room temperature for three days.",
